The contract contains a critical vulnerability allowing arbitrary deletion by any user.

### Vulnerability: Arbitrary Delete
### Explanation: The contract fails to restrict OnComplete.DeleteApplication to authorized entities, allowing any user to permanently delete the application without authorization checks.
### Risk: Critical - Complete loss of application state and functionality through unauthorized deletion
